 "id": "1654612319998035", "version": "1.0.7", "version_code": 65, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1614607450665189", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1653309593461641"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2403174663506544"}]}, "change_log": "# New Content\n\n## Weekly Challenges\n- Weekly Challenges are here!\n- Complete a new set of challenges each week to earn exclusive rewards.\n- **This week's exclusive reward:** **Red Cyber Rapier**\n\n## Level System\n- Earn EXP by playing matches and level up your **Lifetime Level**.\n- Current level cap: **20**\n\n## New Ability\n- **Curve Edge**\nA new ability that curves the ball's trajectory, making it harder for opponents to predict.\n\n## New Skin\n- **Ninja Assassin Outfit**\nA brand new outfit for players who prefer a stealthy look.\n\n# Improvements\n\n- **Voice Changer**\nTemporarily removed while we explore a better implementation. It will return in a future update.\n\n- **Match Joining**\nPlayers now join or leave matchmaking by physically jumping into or out of the arena.\n\n# Fixes\n\n- Fixed an issue where the ball could pass through your blade after eliminating a player and immediately retargeting you.\n- Fixed an issue where **Dragon Spiral** could appear larger than intended.", "created_date": 1783581148, "id": "1653309593461641", "version": "1.0.7", "version_code": 64, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}